  "hard_rules": [
    "one exact closed materialized source snapshot and compatibility profile",
    "repository branch tag latest and provider names are provenance not floating authority",
    "blizzard_ui_source never merges with user project reference runtime external or historical universes",
    "E2-C is the only TOC XML project parser path and wow-emmy is the only Lua parser analyzer",
    "one exact client flavor and TOC variant per package with no cross-variant fill",
    "complete inventory and semantic coverage remain separate",
    "source implementation evidence never becomes API Secret taint protected combat runtime or performance authority",
    "core recognizers only and no source package path or popularity semantic conditions",
    "graph proposals retain producer evidence coverage confidence ambiguity rejection and conflicts",
    "platform source publishes in a separate E2-D ProjectStore with exact coherent identities",
    "fingerprints are future comparison inputs and never lineage authority",
    "skeleton input is bounded structured source evidence not Project Map L0 L1 prose or context ranking",
    "removed inputs leave no target analyzer recognizer graph fingerprint source-handle or skeleton-input record",
    "no source hook workflow generator Lua XML code filesystem escape network process editor client raw SQL or runtime data",
    "license and redistribution state is explicit and local indexing does not imply source redistribution",
    "all missing incompatible partial conflicted truncated failed or cancelled capabilities remain explicit",
    "all logical outputs are deterministic under workers input order temp roots provider renames and physical store variation"
  ],
